### Block 1 - Entities and repositories
### Select the "local" environment (http-client.env.json) in IntelliJ.

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create a product  (watch the INSERT in the console)
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "stock": 10
}

### List products
GET {{host}}/products

### Get a product by id  (change productId in http-client.env.json)
GET {{host}}/products/{{productId}}

### Product that does not exist
GET {{host}}/products/99999

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### List customers
GET {{host}}/customers

### Get a customer by id
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customerId}}

### Duplicate email  (unique constraint -> 500, we handle errors later)
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Again",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}
